roup filled up fast, but we’ve added you to the waitlist and will let you know when more spots open.\"),o(\"d5cb1114\",\"Get started with Subscriptions\"),o(\"j2f622ec\",\"You’ve been selected for our test group! Set up your Subscription details now and we’ll let you know when it’s live.\"),o(\"e2cd7000\",\"Almost there...\"),o(\"b3629b92\",\"Just a few more steps to finish setting up your Subscription.\"),o(\"f4619a62\",\"Accept and continue\"),o(\"c5625f84\",\"Describe your Subscription perks\"),o(\"c7289544\",\"Set a Subscription price\"),o(\"aaf68c58\",\"Confirm your payout details\"),o(\"b8a69fa0\",\"Subscriptions Terms\"),o(\"ad4a92a2\",\"Badge\"),o(\"d5aa8de0\",\"Give your Subscribers badges\"),o(\"j0bbda92\",\"Nothing to change or edit here. All of your Subscribers will automatically get a public badge when they Subscribe.\"),o(\"e18b7a72\",\"Review\"),o(\"be76dc34\",\"Add description\"),o(\"ef5406e4\",\"Add introduction\"),o(\"ea8a3d2e\",\"Pricing setup\"),o(\"f77bb179\",function(e){return\"Confirm your \"+e.price+\" selection\"}),o(\"g2a6f160\",\"Double-check and confirm your Subscription price. You won’t be able to come back and change the price after you set it.\"),o(\"g767d1c9\",\"Note: you won’t be able to change it\"),o(\"df057690\",\"Choose what your Subscribers pay\"),o(\"g5923869\",function(e){return e.price+\" per month\"}),o(\"f025ab3a\",\"Build a bigger, broader base\"),o(\"c962df0e\",\"Infrequent posting and interacting with Subscribers\"),o(\"ib075804\",\"Expand your base and maximize revenue\"),o(\"fc04f3a6\",\"Moderate posting and interacting with Subscribers\"),o(\"c246656e\",\"Build an intimate base\"),o(\"h0c5405c\",\"Regular posting and interacting with Subscribers\"),o(\"f2d2153d\",function(e){return\"Most creators charge \"+e.price+\" but you can choose any price you want\"}),o(\"e1453e45\",\"Learn more\"),o(\"f1cb36b8\",\"Payout setup\"),o(\"g88e146c\",\"Your account is pending\"),o(\"dfe973a6\",\"Thanks for providing your payout details. You’ll receive a notification with next steps as soon as Stripe has reviewed your information.\"),o(\"ja884230\",\"Set up your payout details\"),o(\"a3f6a966\",\"Connect Stripe account\"),o(\"cb031e44\",\"You’ll be taken to Stripe to connect your account. If you have an existing Stripe account you’d like to use, enter the email address of that account when prompted for an email by Stripe. Note: your Stripe email may be different than your X email.\"),o(\"ebfb897c\",\"Examples\"),o(\"dc4feb1a\",\"Not sure what to say?\"),o(\"h9b9d486\",\"The kind of content you offer Subscribers is entirely up to you. Here are some examples to help get you started.\"),o(\"ic130fd6\",\"You’ll get some cool behind-the-scenes content, early peeks at my books and other projects, and monthly AMAs.\"),o(\"dd913e24\",\"You’re in for my hot takes, unscripted thoughts, and extra content from yours truly.\"),o(\"b737ee66\",\"Get ready for a VIP experience. Think: Subscriber-only content like polls, videos, and deals.\"),o(\"a0bb2076\",\"Keep your intro short and sweet, you’ll be able to describe your content later. Here are a few examples to help get you started.\"),o(\"fe076612\",\"Hi and welcome to my Subscriptions page! I’m so glad you’re here. Thanks for making it possible for me to do what I love.\"),o(\"g7f66daa\",\"What’s up everyone? Thanks for checking out my Subscription. I think you’ll like what I have in store for you.\"),o(\"hbe4f99e\",\"Hey there! Can’t wait to share some top secret content and get to know you even better :)\"),o(\"fb278c82\",\"What’s this preview?\"),o(\"j6cab6ec\",\"This is what people see before they Subscribe to you. Tweak and edit your descriptions until you’ve got them just right.\"),o(\"f2b1e83e\",\"Grok & Third-Party Collaborators\"),o(\"e110a46c\",\"Delete conversation history\"),o(\"ebc4fda0\",\"You’re about to delete your grok conversation history. You will not be able to access these conversations again.\"),o(\"c90fe716\",\"Do you want to delete your conversations?\"),o(\"a8d516a4\",\"X may share with xAI your X public data as well as your user interactions, inputs and results with Grok on X to train and fine-tune Grok and other AI models developed by xAI. This helps us continuously improve your user experience.\"),o(\"a127886c\",\"Allow Grok to remember your conversation history\"),o(\"f49b39b8\",\"Allow Grok to remember details from your previous conversations. You can delete individual conversations to forget the associated details.\"),o(\"b7de9ad2\",\"Allow X to personalize your experience with Grok\"),o(\"ed141096\",\"Allow your X data as well as your interactions, inputs, and results with Grok to be used for personalizing your Grok experience X may share with xAI your X data as well as your user interactions, inputs and results with Grok to personalize your experience with Grok and other AI models developed by xAI. This helps us continuously improve your user experience. \"),o(\"e6ba42de\",\"Ad Revenue Share\"),o(\"ebc16756\",\"Creator Revenue Share\"),o(\"da4cd6fa\",\"Unfortunately, you’re not yet eligible for Ads Revenue Sharing. You’ll need to meet the below requirements to participate:\"),o(\"b2961492\",\"Unfortunately, you’re not yet eligible for Creator Revenue Sharing. You’ll need to meet the below requirements to participate:\"),o(\"d3789528\",\"About Ad Rev Share\"),o(\"aa0ff456\",\"About Creator Rev Share\"),o(\"bf214f48\",\"Okay\"),o(\"b2b4d592\",\"Subscribe to Premium or Verified Organizations\"),o(\"fbb03ba6\",\"500 Premium followers\"),o(\"hb4c5169\",function(e){return\"Have at least \"+e.impression_number+\"M impressions on your posts within the last 3 months\"}),o(\"f91685ba\",\"You are automatically eligible to get paid for your posts!\"),o(\"a9f0e0fa\",\"As a Premium or Verified Organizations subscriber, you are automatically eligible for ads revenue sharing. Your payout is based on the number of verified impressions on ads shown in the replies to your posts.\"),o(\"c694e3e4\",\"As a