account?\"),o(\"b80bdc40\",\"Automated accounts are programmed to perform certain actions automatically through the X API. Like posting a region’s weather conditions, for example. They’re created and managed by other people on X.\"),o(\"a01ac9b6\",\"Labels let the world know who’s managing the automated account. Once an automated account owner has connected their managing account, a label will appear on the automated account profile and posts.\"),o(\"b989e1fe\",\"Do I need to label my automated accounts?\"),o(\"i2d599aa\",\"How do I label my automated account?\"),o(\"gd5bed72\",\"Create a managing account\"),o(\"g6d44432\",\"A managing account is the human-run account responsible for the automated account.\"),o(\"e20a69e8\",\"Connect your managing and automated account\"),o(\"d2f88358\",\"Connect your accounts from the Automation page in your settings.\"),o(\"e427f632\",\"Your account is labeled!\"),o(\"a4d7cffa\",\"Once the accounts are connected, the automated account will have a label.\"),o(\"a18d6a7d\",\"new rules\"),o(\"e9965c14\",\"automated account label FAQ\"),o(\"ee78c192\",\"What’s a PCF account?\"),o(\"c3f35e0c\",\"A PCF account depicts another person, group, or organization in their profile to discuss, satirize, or share information about that entity.\"),o(\"d019b5fa\",\"Do I need to label my PCF account?\"),o(\"dd04f24e\",\"Yes. The PCF label ensures people on X are not confused by your account, informing them that your account is not affiliated with the subject of the profile. If not labeled, your account may violate the Authenticity policy.\"),o(\"hb0f8bbc\",\"How do I label my PCF account?\"),o(\"g69acc5c\",\"Just click ‘Got it’, and we’ll take you to your profile settings to set an account label!\"),o(\"d313d431\",\"Authenticity policy\"),o(\"a3f22d8e\",\"Select the kinds of notifications you get about your activities, interests, and recommendations.\"),o(\"bc20979a\",\"X and its partners use cookies to provide you with a better, safer, and faster s