 helpful context to people who may encounter it.\"),o(\"ec30e9ac\",\"Other contributors will rate the helpfulness of your note\"),o(\"e0c42f80\",\"If it reaches a status of Helpful, it will be shown as context to everyone who sees the post\"),o(\"ife4baaa\",\"Community Notes doesn’t work by majority rule. To identify notes that are helpful to a wide range of people, statuses require agreement between contributors who have sometimes disagreed in their past ratings. This helps prevent one-sided ratings.\"),o(\"a0c552ee\",\"Your impact will be shown here\"),o(\"a4e5ea3c\",\"You haven’t rated any notes yet\"),o(\"g9a28bde\",\"Browse notes that need help\"),o(\"dc0046e2\",\"Browse the Community Notes home\"),o(\"fecae168\",\"There, you’ll find notes that need more ratings, and where your rating specifically can help.\"),o(\"h525e29e\",\"Help find notes that could be helpful to many people\"),o(\"f6db7706\",\"The best Community Notes directly address the post’s claim, are written in helpful and clear language, and add sources that a wide range of people would find reliable.\"),o(\"f636b582\",\"Help find notes that aren’t helpful\"),o(\"f58f4f62\",\"Rating low quality notes improves Community Notes by giving feedback to note authors, and allowing contributors to focus on the most promising notes.\"),o(\"cf30af22\",\"Did you know?\"),o(\"d145b0fa\",\"Note statuses aren’t reached by majority rule. To identify notes that are helpful to a wide range of people, note statuses require agreement between contributors who have sometimes disagreed in their past ratings. This helps prevent one-sided ratings.\"),o(\"c20a24cc\",\"Congratulations!\"),o(\"d01b8fc8\",\"You’re a top Community Notes writer.\"),o(\"jbe2ad46\",\"Writers with a high Writing Impact and a high proportion of notes with a status of “Helpful” get access to:\"),o(\"d2dc3d4c\",\"Priority for note alerts\"),o(\"heb73816\",\"Top Writers’ note proposals are more likely to trigger notifications to get rater’s attention.\"